s those fees — per aging bu\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mcket and in total — alongside the overdue\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22mamounts it already reports. The fee is derived at report time from `dueOn`\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m, `today` and the invoice's existing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m`totals()`; nothing new is stored in `data/invoices.json`, and no new comm\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22mand or flag is introduced.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m… +81 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
